    "problem": "${}_{52}{P}_{2}=$",
    "worked_solution": "The formula for ${}_{n}{P}_{r}$ is given by\n\n$$\n{}_{n}{P}_{r}=\\frac{n!}{(n-r)!}\\,.\n$$\n\nSubstituting $n=52$ and $r=2$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{}_{52}{P}_{2} & =\\frac{52!}{(52-2)!} \\\\  & =\\frac{52!}{50!} \\\\  & =\\frac{52\\cdot 51\\cdot \\cancel{50!}}{\\cancel{50!}} \\\\  & =52\\cdot 51 \\\\  & =2\\,652.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
